# Reviewed exceptions for the production image trivy gate (publish workflow).
#
# The gate fails on fixable HIGH|CRITICAL vulnerabilities; unfixed base-image
# issues are reported but do not block (see the trivy step's --ignore-unfixed).
# Add an entry ONLY with a one-line review note, and delete entries when the
# base image is rebuilt:
#
#   CVE-0000-0000   # reviewed: <who, when, why it cannot be exploited>
